# src/apps/daemon/internal/integrations/presets

## Purpose
Curated configuration/preset data exposed through product adapters.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `integrations` (rank 3; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

## Contents
- Direct files (4): `presets.go`, `presets_test.go`, `updater.go`, `updater_test.go`

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Go package: `presets`.
